{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ensemblesbox\/boxcloudfilesystem"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/documentation\/EnsemblesBox"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/documentation\/EnsemblesBox\/BoxCloudFileSystem"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/documentation\/EnsemblesBox\/BoxCloudFileSystem\/init(client:)"],"generated":true,"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/documentation\/EnsemblesBox\/BoxCloudFileSystem\/client","doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/documentation\/EnsemblesBox\/BoxCloudFileSystem\/isConnected"],"generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/documentation\/EnsemblesBox\/BoxCloudFileSystem\/connect()","doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/documentation\/EnsemblesBox\/BoxCloudFileSystem\/contentsOfDirectory(atPath:)","doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/documentation\/EnsemblesBox\/BoxCloudFileSystem\/createDirectory(atPath:)","doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/documentation\/EnsemblesBox\/BoxCloudFileSystem\/downloadFile(atPath:toLocalFile:)","doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/documentation\/EnsemblesBox\/BoxCloudFileSystem\/fetchUserIdentity()","doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/documentation\/EnsemblesBox\/BoxCloudFileSystem\/fileExists(atPath:)","doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/documentation\/EnsemblesBox\/BoxCloudFileSystem\/removeItem(atPath:)","doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/documentation\/EnsemblesBox\/BoxCloudFileSystem\/uploadLocalFile(atPath:toPath:)"],"generated":true,"title":"Instance Methods","anchor":"Instance-Methods"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/documentation\/EnsemblesBox\/BoxCloudFileSystem\/CloudFileSystem-Implementations"],"generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations","anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"BoxCloudFileSystem","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Class","title":"BoxCloudFileSystem","symbolKind":"class","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"EnsemblesBox"}],"externalID":"s:12EnsemblesBox0B15CloudFileSystemC","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"BoxCloudFileSystem"}]},"abstract":[{"text":"A cloud file system backed by Box, using the Box Swift SDK (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BoxSdkGen"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"final"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"BoxCloudFileSystem"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"overview"},{"type":"aside","name":"Important","style":"important","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This backend requires the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/box\/box-ios-sdk.git","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"package. With the source distribution, enable the ","type":"text"},{"code":"Box","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" package trait and SPM resolves it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"automatically. With the binary distribution (XCFrameworks), add BoxSDK as a separate","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"package dependency in your project.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Box uses numeric IDs rather than paths to identify files and folders. This backend"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bridges the path-based "},{"code":"CloudFileSystem","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol onto Box’s ID-based API by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"walking the folder hierarchy to resolve Ensembles paths"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(e.g. "},{"code":"ensembleId\/events\/file.json","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") to Box folder and file IDs."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Resolved IDs are cached in internal dictionaries to minimize API calls. The cache"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is invalidated when items are deleted or when not-found errors indicate stale entries."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The app creates and configures a "},{"code":"BoxClient","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" with its own authentication"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and injects it at init time:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let auth = BoxDeveloperTokenAuth(token: \"your-token\")","let client = BoxClient(auth: auth)","let cloudFS = BoxCloudFileSystem(client: client)"]},{"text":"Authentication","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Authentication"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The Box Swift SDK supports multiple authentication methods. Create a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"BoxClient","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" with the appropriate auth for your use case:"}]},{"text":"Developer Token (testing only)","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Developer-Token-testing-only"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Get a short-lived token from "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/developer.box.com\/"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"under your app’s configuration page. These tokens expire after 60 minutes."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let auth = BoxDeveloperTokenAuth(token: \"your-developer-token\")","let client = BoxClient(auth: auth)","let cloudFS = BoxCloudFileSystem(client: client)"]},{"text":"OAuth 2.0 (production apps)","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"OAuth-20-production-apps"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Register your app at "},{"overridingTitle":"developer.box.com","isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/developer.box.com\/","overridingTitleInlineContent":[{"text":"developer.box.com","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"configure an OAuth 2.0 redirect URI:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let config = OAuthConfig(clientId: \"your-client-id\", clientSecret: \"your-secret\")","let auth = BoxOAuth(config: config)","\/\/ Call auth.authorize(url:) with your redirect URL after the OAuth flow","let client = BoxClient(auth: auth)","let cloudFS = BoxCloudFileSystem(client: client)"]},{"text":"Client Credentials Grant (server-side)","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Client-Credentials-Grant-server-side"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For server-to-server integration without user interaction:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let config = CCGConfig(","    clientId: \"your-client-id\",","    clientSecret: \"your-secret\",","    userId: \"user-id\"",")","let auth = BoxCCGAuth(config: config)","let client = BoxClient(auth: auth)","let cloudFS = BoxCloudFileSystem(client: client)"]},{"text":"Threading","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Threading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This class is "},{"code":"@unchecked Sendable","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". The "},{"code":"BoxClient","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" handles its own thread"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"safety internally. Mutable state (caches, "},{"code":"loggedIn","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" flag) is accessed only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from async methods that are serialized by the ensemble’s operation queue."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/9Ensembles15CloudFileSystemP","doc:\/\/E